From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:47:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 084/113] arm64: dts: qcom: sm7250: Add interconnect consumers

Once the interconnect providers take over, every path needs a vote:
- CPUs: per-cluster OPP tables matching the cpufreq-hw LUT, with the
  DDR bandwidth of the downstream LLCC to DDR memlat tables;
- GPU: the gfx-mem path, with the downstream default bus level of
  each power level;
- UFS, USB, SDHC2, IPA and QUP wrapper 1 with its serial engines, with
  the same paths as SM8250.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

Assisted-by: LLM dtschema
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RmfiVDW3KWZdb9c3iDGRYg
